Treat IArray as pure under capture checking

IArray dealiases to (mutable, and under strict mutability
capability-classified) Array, so every stdlib IArray factory or
extension result was decorated ^{fresh} through the opaque alias,
although the interface exposes no mutation: constructing an IArray is
semantically caps.freeze. derivesFromCapTrait now stops at the IArray
head, which removes the spurious freshness from classification, freeze
and Setup alike. Mutable Array itself is unaffected.

Enabled by `-Z:pure-iarrays`; without it, upstream's code runs at every site this
patch touches.

